---
import Person from '../assets/icons/solid/person.svg';
---

<section id="about" class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
  <div class="card-body space-y-6">
    <h2 class="card-title text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
      <Person class="h-7 w-7 shrink-0 fill-primary" aria-label="Person icon" />
      About Me
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-5 text-base-content/90">
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Hey there! I'm a full-stack software engineer with 9+ years of
        experience building web products and cloud-native systems. At Cohesity,
        I work as a Member of Technical Staff III on problems spanning frontend
        architecture and backend systems.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        I have also served as Scrum Master for two years, guiding a team of 7
        developers through planning, delivery, and retrospectives. I value the
        human side of engineering: pairing on difficult problems, mentoring
        junior developers, and helping teams turn sound technical decisions into
        software people enjoy using.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Curiosity keeps me experimenting with new technologies and side
        projects, but the goal stays practical: learn from each project, improve
        the next decision, and build things that matter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
